OL,3,APolice investigate death of boy, 3,
OL,4,Aafter incident at nursery
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched into
OL,7,Fthe death of a three-year-old boy
OL,8,Ffollowing an incident at a nursery in
OL,9,FGreater Manchester, police said.
OL,11,FThe boy became critically ill at Cosy
OL,12,FToes Nursery in Middleton shortly
OL,13,Fbefore 16:00 GMT on Monday 2 November.
OL,15,FHe was rushed to hospital, where he
OL,16,Fdied three days later.
OL,18,FGreater Manchester Police said his
OL,19,Ffamily are being supported by
OL,20,Fspecialist officers.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
